{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1534847-using-exalted-style-of-magic-in-ars-magica-as-breakthroughs","id":1534847,"title":"Using Exalted Style of Magic in Ars Magica as Breakthroughs?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-04-27T22:19:06-07:00","id":1534847,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon5.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> Using Exalted Style of Magic in Ars Magica as Breakthroughs?","content":"Hi Everyone,<br /> <br /> Appealing to those exalted fans who've had some Ars Magic exposure, I'm trying to compile all the things Exalted Magic can do that standard Ars Magica Hermetic Magic cannot. Below is a list of breakthroughs a Hermetic Magus might get from studying Exalted Style Magic. (At some point my campaign writeup will include how this all happened.) Any feedback or thoughts on other things Exalted Magic can do that Hermetic magic can't I'd be happy to add to this list and/or discuss further.<br /> <br /> Hermetic:<ol class=\"decimal\"><li>Spells that Bypass the need for Arcane Connections (Exalted spells can target a person directly so long as the sorceror has met them in the past i.e. Infallible Messenger) ?New Target: Sympathetic Connection or Range: Unlimited.</li> <li>Spells that affect the Lunar Sphere (this is not a limit to Sorcery in Exalted)</li> <li>Limit of Time - can scry on the future or the past (this is not a limit to Sorcery in Exalted)</li> <li>Hermetic Workings, effectively rituals that take weeks, months, seasons or years to accomplish that accomplish significantly grander effects beyond a Magus's normal lab total.</li> <li>Limit of Aging - Sorcerous Workings in Exalted can make a character near immortal, however, always with a conditions in which it fails/doesn't work and a catch.</li> <li>Restore Fatigue - Not exactly a mechanic in Exalted, but certainly not a limitation either.</li> <li>Create new things without raw vis (bypass Limit of Creation)</li> <li>Bypass Limit of Warping - Sorcerous workings in Exalted can remove Flaws (with experience points.)</li> <li>Shaping Initiations - The gift does not exist in Exalted and as such Mortals can be initiated into magic. These can optionally bestow some kind of Virtue upon the mortal for a cost in experience points.</li> </ol><br /> Major:<ol class=\"decimal\"><li>Control Spells - For each magnitude of spells a magus knows, one may be their &quot;Control Spell&quot; - a spell that permanently changes the magus in minor way but also boosts the potency of the spell in some fashion. For Magnitude 1 to 10 spells, the spell is one magnitude more powerful, whether range, duration, target or potency. This increases to two magnitudes for magnitude 11+ spells, and the magus is more significantly changed.</li> </ol><br /> Minor:<ol class=\"decimal\"><li>Fast Rituals: Most spells in Exalted that have ritual level effects can be cast in combat time - &quot;Ritual&quot; spells now take a number of rounds equal to magnitude.</li> <li>Target: Radius. Radius is a function of the Magus's power (In Exalted Many spells have a radius of effect based on Permanent Essence, which has no clear Ars Magica Equivalent).</li> <li>More powerful summoning spells - that instantly summon the being to the Magus's presence, and bind it to the Master's will for a year and a day, OR, bind the being to a specific task for eternity or until the spell is canceled/countered somehow.</li> <li>Decade Duration: Solar Circle Spells can affect an area for up to a decade in the core book.</li> <li>Target: Battlegroup. In Exalted, spells can be cast at armies or subunits without extra effort.</li> </ol>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2783,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2783-tytalus","user":"Tytalus","date":".  Details. 04-28-2024, 01:21 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.